%I A398895 #9 Aug 22 2026 21:08:48
%S A398895 12,48,144,192,2880,1728,366576,365952,42841008,71951520
%N A398895 Number of words of length n over the 12 Quarter Turn Metric (QTM) generators {U,D,L,R,F,B,U',D',L',R',F',B'} whose product in the Rubik's Cube group has the maximum order among all words of that length.
%C A398895 The count is expected to grow combinatorially rather than stabilize, since once a length reaches the plateau order, any admissible length-2 padding word (X X') applied in any position that keeps the order unchanged multiplies the number of solutions.
%H A398895 Simone Marinelli, <a href="/A398895/a398895.c.txt">C program</a>
